James Rising requested creative and clear title suggestions for a grant proposal on PFAS and its impacts on health. The project aims to establish a causal framework connecting industrial pollution to health outcomes, specifically focusing on prenatal exposure to PFAS and adverse birth outcomes. I provided a range of title options, categorized into creative titles, clear titles, and a few that combined both elements. The creative titles included phrases that capture the narrative of pollution and health, while the clear titles directly conveyed the project's purpose and methodology. Additionally, I suggested hybrid titles that balanced creativity with clarity for optimal impact.
